{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-001", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n星汉集团差旅费用管理办法（2024年修订版）\n文件编号：XC-CW-2024-007 生效日期：2024-07-01 维护部门：财务共享服务中心\n第一章 总则", "labels": ["effective"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "957335cc40bffd36197846b6600898e9f28b3705cde44d8f0ee2644c1e1865c4"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-002", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第一条 为规范集团员工境内差旅费用的审批、开支与报销行为，特制定本办法。差旅费用包括：城际交通费、住宿费、伙食补助、市内交通补助四类。", "labels": ["approval"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "6febd896fb2715c78ab5cef7f1df7b8f573fc08b85884c05b6b59dc26a36d65d"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-003", "chunk_index": 3, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第二条 差旅费用遵循\"业务必需、标准控制、包干从简、合规留痕\"原则。\n第二章 城市分级", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "e63e92ca05a993c2afc6090de3793d68dd7db44fa672de0de419be1d2f3876bc"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-004", "chunk_index": 4, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第三条 出差城市分为四类：\n一类城市：北京、上海、广州、深圳；\n新一线城市：杭州、南京、成都、武汉、西安、苏州、重庆；\n二类城市：其他省会城市及计划单列市（青岛、大连、宁波、厦门）；\n三类城市：其余未列明城市。\n第三章 交通标准", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "8de54899871d281f3a0f8379ae1062d7e6fa6a99bd9eac0e9ba65e05d04c10be"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-005", "chunk_index": 5, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第四条 城际交通标准按职级执行：\n普通员工（P4及以下）：高铁/动车二等座、飞机经济舱、火车硬卧；\n经理级（P5-P7）：高铁/动车一等座、飞机经济舱；\n总监级及以上（P8+）：高铁/动车一等座、飞机商务舱（商务舱需事前在OA审批）。", "labels": ["approval"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "8dcd760316c7c10e0cd8c54224e0ac45112cf51a544aae3eab6bafd5ad08a3d4"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-006", "chunk_index": 6, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第五条 航程在2小时（含）以内且高铁可达的，原则上应乘坐高铁；确需乘飞机的，应选择经济舱折扣票。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "4a82752ccff89ab3c9d281fed6fca13e8644989a9be5b5e08c651f2bf519905a"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-007", "chunk_index": 7, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第六条 市内交通实行包干制，统一为80元/人/天，不再单独报销出租车、网约车票据。\n第四章 住宿标准", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "b4f20834070b1f1cb4907c57c313c5d67ef117aa73c4b3c1a2cee553a3da6794"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-008", "chunk_index": 8, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第七条 住宿费用上限（元/晚）：\n普通员工：一类城市500、新一线400、二类350、三类300；\n经理级：一类城市700、新一线600、二类500、三类450；\n总监级及以上：一类城市900、新一线800、二类700、三类600。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "425e85ecb8ca7f83d36578dff8acd132dc169a22171335eefa97e597ce78ed56"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-009", "chunk_index": 9, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第八条 住宿超支部分原则上由个人承担；因大型展会、政府指定接待等客观原因超支的，附证明材料经中心总监审批后可据实报销。", "labels": ["approval"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "61a11f187400a65cf834ba3b045972c9666bc3e8c31768fa94854a5d64333210"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-010", "chunk_index": 10, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第九条 同性两人同行出差鼓励合住，合住双方每人每晚可上浮50元住宿标准。\n第五章 伙食补助", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "52d3d53acce19c096e10f4d5497ee1ad9ee8f2b65954a6522296abaec96938d6"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-011", "chunk_index": 11, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第十条 伙食补助实行包干制，无需发票，标准为（元/人/天）：\n一类城市150；新一线120；二类100；三类80。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "591d1517fee3c62746da1292f005b17d51a563225bd0737ab231cd9e710f16bc"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-012", "chunk_index": 12, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第十一条 出差天数按自然日计算，出发日与返回日各计1天。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "e8b29a1bd843038b91437796a0c6570147d8918b7c829295eb184316eb0b36a5"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-013", "chunk_index": 13, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第十二条 连续驻场超过15天的，自第16天起改按《驻场补贴管理细则》执行，停发差旅伙食补助，改发驻场补贴120元/天。\n第六章 审批与报销流程", "labels": ["approval"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "cf0ca43bb554e9be3859b3038c794a7632e61cd1d0721c8006e53ad37f87716d"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-014", "chunk_index": 14, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第十三条 出差申请需提前3个工作日在OA系统提交；紧急出差可经直属上级口头同意后先行出发，但须在24小时内补提OA申请。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "dcdff41d9ade7dfcbf50e06f0b210f9c6bde80610ac23196b3963ca8fdb69334"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-015", "chunk_index": 15, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第十四条 审批链：\n普通员工：直属上级 → 部门负责人；\n经理级：部门负责人 → 中心总监；\n跨市出差超过5天（含）或单次预计费用超过10000元（含）的，加签财务BP节点。", "labels": ["approval"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "54dcc9ac7f45c47d64c262794bd9c30acfa2a805463420fa0654a3a8d4b9dd6f"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-016", "chunk_index": 16, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第十五条 报销须在出差结束后30个自然日内提交；逾期报销需中心总监特批，并计入部门月度合规考核。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "79910f42e5ea9a43d98a0056afdc237410d913820afd9c529a20d6a6331d71c0"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-017", "chunk_index": 17, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第十六条 报销票据要求：\n1. 须提供增值税发票，发票抬头为公司注册全称\"星汉集团有限公司\"，税号完整；\n2. 电子发票须上传PDF原件，截图、拍照件不予受理；\n3. 发票遗失的，须取得开票方加盖发票专用章的存根联复印件，附《发票遗失情况说明》，经部门负责人审批后报销；每人每年限2次，超出须财务共享中心总监审批。\n第七章 合规红线", "labels": ["approval"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "0c9bb4901fc866ce801d6447105baa229d6718043a0828c37f2b3ce8bc67af13"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-018", "chunk_index": 18, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第十七条 下列行为属合规红线，一经查实全额不予报销，并记入员工诚信档案；情节严重的移交审计与法务：\n1. 虚构出差行程或虚开发票；\n2. 拆分费用以规避审批权限或报销标准；\n3. 以个人消费票据冒充公务费用；\n4. 将客户宴请费用混入差旅费报销（客户宴请按《业务招待管理办法》单独执行）。\n第八章 附则", "labels": ["approval", "permission"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "6f21bb18636bd36e0d083436d049dd2e28cf7a361be9d8762f206d0cda6c4e4d"}
{"document_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026", "title": "差旅费用管理办法", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "policy", "version": "2.1", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-TRAVEL-2026-019", "chunk_index": 19, "text": "差旅费用管理办法\n第十八条 本办法由财务共享服务中心负责解释，修订自发布之日起执行。\n咨询入口：OA-财务客服，或拨打分机8080。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge差旅费用管理办法.txt", "text_sha256": "c9d2f68ea7263eb4bef6f49bab98e56dc582e5d25c9d0c2afba3422b57b4cbc5"}
{"document_id": "DATA-EXPENSE-2026", "title": "报销单据表", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "record", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "confidential", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "DATA-EXPENSE-2026-001", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "报销单据表\n星汉集团 报销单据台账（节选）\n数据来源：财务共享中心OA系统 导出时间：2024-09-06\n------------------------------------------------------------\n单据号：BX-20240905-001\n申请人：陈晓宇\n部门：销售一部\n职级：普通员工\n费用类型：差旅费\n目的地：北京\n出差天数：4天\n申请金额：3860.00元\n票据张数：9张\n提交日期：2024-09-06\n当前审批节点：部门负责人\n状态：审核中\n审核意见：（无）\n------------------------------------------------------------\n单据号：BX-20240905-002\n申请人：刘志远\n部门：研发中心\n职级：普通员工\n费用类型：差旅费\n目的地：上海\n出差天数：3天\n申请金额：2950.00元\n票据张数：6张\n提交日期：2024-09-06\n当前审批节点：财务共享中心\n状态：已驳回\n审核意见：住宿单价650元/晚超普通员工一类城市标准500元/晚，超支450元需个人承担，请修改后重新提交\n------------------------------------------------------------\n单据号：BX-20240905-003\n申请人：王芳\n部门：财务部\n职级：经理级\n费用类型：差旅费\n目的地：杭州\n出差天数：2天\n申请金额：1720.00元\n票据张数：5张\n提交日期：2024-09-05\n当前审批节点：已结束\n状态：已报销\n审核意见：全额报销，款项预计3个工作日内到账\n---------", "labels": ["approval", "calculation"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge报销单据表.txt", "text_sha256": "0413ea6ddf3d26d1e414518e1b28eb2bd79a905c41dcd6881632a579b8db8185"}
{"document_id": "DATA-EXPENSE-2026", "title": "报销单据表", "scenario": "travel", "document_type": "record", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "confidential", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "DATA-EXPENSE-2026-002", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "报销单据表\n---------------------------------------------------\n单据号：BX-20240905-004\n申请人：赵磊\n部门：销售二部\n职级：经理级\n费用类型：业务招待费\n目的地：（本地）\n出差天数：1天\n申请金额：4200.00元\n票据张数：3张\n提交日期：2024-09-05\n当前审批节点：中心总监\n状态：审核中\n审核意见：招待费需附客户名单与事前审批单\n------------------------------------------------------------\n单据号：BX-20240905-005\n申请人：孙悦\n部门：人力资源部\n职级：普通员工\n费用类型：培训费\n目的地：（本地）\n出差天数：2天\n申请金额：12800.00元\n票据张数：2张\n提交日期：2024-09-04\n当前审批节点：财务共享中心\n状态：已驳回\n审核意见：发票抬头为个人姓名，非公司全称，请换票后重提", "labels": ["approval", "calculation"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge报销单据表.txt", "text_sha256": "3ce71433dfcf300fea5a46f4f944a2c4a41fe4fcdd22b387fd4078201ce6366a"}
{"document_id": "DATA-COST-2026", "title": "月度成本执行表", "scenario": "cost", "document_type": "record", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "internal", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "DATA-COST-2026-001", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "月度成本执行表\n星汉集团 2024年8月 月度成本执行表\n编制部门：财务共享服务中心 单位：元 统计周期：2024-08-01 至 2024-08-31\n说明：预算执行率 = 月度实际 / 月度预算 × 100%；同比变动为与去年同期对比；执行率超过110%或低于70%的科目需填写差异原因并标红预警。\n【差旅费】\n月度预算：450000元\n月度实际：486500元\n预算执行率：108.1%\n同比变动：+12.4%\n差异原因：Q3大客户拜访与投标频次上升\n责任部门：销售部\n状态：超支预警\n【会议费】\n月度预算：60000元\n月度实际：71200元\n预算执行率：118.7%\n同比变动：+22.0%\n差异原因：集团年中大会与新品评审会集中召开\n责任部门：行政部\n状态：超支预警\n【业务招待费】\n月度预算：150000元\n月度实际：142300元\n预算执行率：94.9%\n同比变动：-8.2%\n差异原因：招待事前审批标准收紧\n责任部门：销售部\n状态：正常\n【培训费】\n月度预算：200000元\n月度实际：195000元\n预算执行率：97.5%\n同比变动：+3.1%\n差异原因：校招新员工集中入职培训\n责任部门：人力资源部\n状态：正常\n【办公费】\n月度预算：120000元\n月度实际：98400元\n预算执行率：82.0%\n同比变动：-5.6%\n差异原因：无纸化办公与集采降价见效\n责任部门：行政部\n状态：正常\n【IT采购费】\n月度预算：800000元\n月度实际：765000元\n预算执行率：95.6%\n同比变动：+15.3%\n差异原因：AI算力服务器扩容（一次性投入）\n责任部门：信息技术部\n状态：正常（一次性）\n【招", "labels": ["approval", "calculation"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge月度成本执行表.txt", "text_sha256": "575bca01fdabc636e1ffe834f6ceb36c957def08a9eda3138b461773e38e99b9"}
{"document_id": "DATA-COST-2026", "title": "月度成本执行表", "scenario": "cost", "document_type": "record", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2025-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "internal", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "DATA-COST-2026-002", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "月度成本执行表\n聘费】\n月度预算：90000元\n月度实际：61000元\n预算执行率：67.8%\n同比变动：-18.5%\n差异原因：编制冻结暂停部分社招岗位\n责任部门：人力资源部\n状态：预算结余", "labels": ["calculation"], "source_path": "knowledge/knowledge月度成本执行表.txt", "text_sha256": "8e0fb23ab4ac67d06215eb53fa13c32295b460d6eda0e0e0cfffb4d6d6ea1ab2"}
{"document_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026", "title": "付款管理办法", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026-001", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "付款管理办法\n星汉集团（合成示例）付款管理办法\n本文件为星汉集团合成示例，仅用于软件测试，不对应任何真实企业、人员或交易。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/payment_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "86ff061a9e22327ded772c1888ffbf7d2ef0dfbe313af9981acf61ae70e21a1a"}
{"document_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026", "title": "付款管理办法", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026-002", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "付款管理办法\n第一条 付款申请必须关联已审批合同、供应商主数据和预算项目，缺一不可。", "labels": ["approval", "constraint", "calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/payment_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "efa4cdc4629e2754613ac3cfa7a941ea17f8e3150f2b3df4992ee5bcacfdb845"}
{"document_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026", "title": "付款管理办法", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026-003", "chunk_index": 3, "text": "付款管理办法\n第二条 预付款比例不得超过合同含税总额的百分之三十；超过时须提交财务负责人专项审批。", "labels": ["approval", "constraint", "calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/payment_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "0f6e0843d337276bedbb3b2373f00c41f393ce60c0d5613c123accd5e1fb076c"}
{"document_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026", "title": "付款管理办法", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026-004", "chunk_index": 4, "text": "付款管理办法\n第三条 到货款支付前必须取得验收单和合法有效的发票；未取得验收单时系统只能转人工复核。", "labels": ["constraint"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/payment_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "5389cc753507d5afaf52843487b569b6a67c765e79640d742087775c0ec3819e"}
{"document_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026", "title": "付款管理办法", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026-005", "chunk_index": 5, "text": "付款管理办法\n第四条 质保金比例为合同含税总额的百分之十，质保期满且无未决质量问题后方可申请。", "labels": ["calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/payment_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "df74438b68bcf846bc40fb325d9253fe7f172e5f494ba97983b9ecfc95aa9c6f"}
{"document_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026", "title": "付款管理办法", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026-006", "chunk_index": 6, "text": "付款管理办法\n第五条 收款账户必须与供应商主数据一致；账户变更须由财务经理线下复核，本系统不自动修改。", "labels": ["constraint"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/payment_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "4dd2ae1f27d4ef075cbba3878a7b3b830b87125d41b19bd05763ca14b586c7e4"}
{"document_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026", "title": "付款管理办法", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026-007", "chunk_index": 7, "text": "付款管理办法\n第六条 单笔付款超过五万元时，审批链在部门负责人之后增加财务负责人节点。", "labels": ["approval"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/payment_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "0b5f12ee00502e9bb9b4beec666add5915e54fa6e29f6aa6b184d9c54400b3a6"}
{"document_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026", "title": "付款管理办法", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026-008", "chunk_index": 8, "text": "付款管理办法\n第七条 本系统只执行预检和生成模拟工单，不自动付款、不自动记账。", "labels": ["approval"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/payment_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "517cb5b97476f3c42f194b1d61baa98038c42be0d6429ee5da1cc867ccd627aa"}
{"document_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026", "title": "付款管理办法", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-PAYMENT-POLICY-2026-009", "chunk_index": 9, "text": "付款管理办法\n第八条 本办法版本为V1.0，自2026年1月1日起生效。", "labels": ["effective"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/payment_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "75992b83f52025557d333df4b00a739332dd49c64fb878cc469a7c85cd6c7593"}
{"document_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026", "title": "合同财务条款审核指引", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026-001", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "合同财务条款审核指引\n星汉集团（合成示例）合同财务条款审核指引\n本文件为星汉集团合成示例，仅用于软件测试，不对应任何真实企业、人员或交易。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/contract_review_guide_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "087da4646a9f14a78f9f7e1a0b468e96d1cf7227a2fdf4bb544f813dcf256df4"}
{"document_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026", "title": "合同财务条款审核指引", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026-002", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "合同财务条款审核指引\n第一条 审核范围包括合同金额、税率、付款里程碑、验收条件、发票要求、质保金和收款账户。", "labels": ["calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/contract_review_guide_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "6413382a9b7c78eafa78d54ddcbf3aa0f76b93032e0dcc8a4a795c468a4e64c3"}
{"document_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026", "title": "合同财务条款审核指引", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026-003", "chunk_index": 3, "text": "合同财务条款审核指引\n第二条 付款里程碑必须使用可验证的事件描述，不得只写适时付款或按甲方要求付款。", "labels": ["constraint"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/contract_review_guide_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "7c74324d3911eb08c5035a57e938790ad113d4ca16a9d89d291bea8721fb1a7c"}
{"document_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026", "title": "合同财务条款审核指引", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026-004", "chunk_index": 4, "text": "合同财务条款审核指引\n第三条 合同条款与结构化字段不一致时，以已签署合同原文为证据并转人工复核，不得静默覆盖。", "labels": ["constraint"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/contract_review_guide_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "de87b0fffee104eeb74de140f89e132008c34e4e45c4c016ff1d79369829ad49"}
{"document_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026", "title": "合同财务条款审核指引", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026-005", "chunk_index": 5, "text": "合同财务条款审核指引\n第四条 预付款、到货款和质保金比例合计不得超过合同总额的百分之一百。", "labels": ["constraint", "calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/contract_review_guide_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "e54afc31d0017b830db0eb19cf20f2858463e4e3fb9bd55acf2e41089994c4bb"}
{"document_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026", "title": "合同财务条款审核指引", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026-006", "chunk_index": 6, "text": "合同财务条款审核指引\n第五条 对缺少税率或发票类型的合同，审核结论必须为待补充，不得推测税务处理。", "labels": ["constraint"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/contract_review_guide_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "4492b95d2877364b8cdf89bd5f2772a947090276ea63785df4bfb352f80c9699"}
{"document_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026", "title": "合同财务条款审核指引", "scenario": "payment", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-CONTRACT-REVIEW-GUIDE-2026-007", "chunk_index": 7, "text": "合同财务条款审核指引\n第六条 本指引版本为V1.0，自2026年1月1日起生效。", "labels": ["effective"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/contract_review_guide_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "2c12c48e95d9fee47c996e4a0775fb243f3d650df0356771e95223f89a589379"}
{"document_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026", "title": "预算管理与调整办法", "scenario": "budget", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026-001", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "预算管理与调整办法\n星汉集团（合成示例）预算管理与调整办法\n本文件为星汉集团合成示例，仅用于软件测试，不对应任何真实企业、人员或交易。", "labels": ["calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/budget_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "082dad59181f8f08e486b6aa72d43d481c1b8e9c6d2a8b4c0fe16224333c3e19"}
{"document_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026", "title": "预算管理与调整办法", "scenario": "budget", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026-002", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "预算管理与调整办法\n第一条 可用预算等于年度预算减去已承诺金额和已发生金额，计算由规则程序完成。", "labels": ["calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/budget_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "f9f2540b434726950dc105a890e1beb6509d62a0a5a161f2370142ca51d27b0d"}
{"document_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026", "title": "预算管理与调整办法", "scenario": "budget", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026-003", "chunk_index": 3, "text": "预算管理与调整办法\n第二条 申请金额不超过可用预算时，可进入部门负责人和财务BP审批。", "labels": ["approval", "calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/budget_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "af9b0e8e0cc2217e355043ca289c590fcb8f6a102a838eab35179275245673da"}
{"document_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026", "title": "预算管理与调整办法", "scenario": "budget", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026-004", "chunk_index": 4, "text": "预算管理与调整办法\n第三条 申请金额超过可用预算时，不得直接提交付款，应先发起预算调整或削减申请金额。", "labels": ["constraint", "calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/budget_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "7a71aa4637f41a0f55912da9a1c6df2ef07f51517e19b3bbf9173d1db11c37e2"}
{"document_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026", "title": "预算管理与调整办法", "scenario": "budget", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026-005", "chunk_index": 5, "text": "预算管理与调整办法\n第四条 预算调整必须写明来源项目、目标项目、调整金额和业务原因，并保持总预算平衡。", "labels": ["constraint", "calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/budget_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "3e92006a0844657b57cb33642ccf3d1402a742766b60536bd53112dbc85c8859"}
{"document_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026", "title": "预算管理与调整办法", "scenario": "budget", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026-006", "chunk_index": 6, "text": "预算管理与调整办法\n第五条 普通员工可以查看公开预算制度；部门预算明细仅向经理和管理员角色开放。", "labels": ["calculation", "permission"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/budget_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "89f894ace53d8a186acd49e4da1e0a85fb5ab527c0c579c898b364a29871dddf"}
{"document_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026", "title": "预算管理与调整办法", "scenario": "budget", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-BUDGET-POLICY-2026-007", "chunk_index": 7, "text": "预算管理与调整办法\n第六条 本办法版本为V1.0，自2026年2月1日起生效。", "labels": ["calculation", "effective"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/budget_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "69635772e4b7216007edae6eb16eb696707623e4af581a2a5ae968eb8f2e1f2c"}
{"document_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026", "title": "财务对账与差异处理规范", "scenario": "reconciliation", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026-001", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "财务对账与差异处理规范\n星汉集团（合成示例）财务对账与差异处理规范\n本文件为星汉集团合成示例，仅用于软件测试，不对应任何真实企业、人员或交易。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/reconciliation_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "70a7aee0719d0d3e2dbad35481df379893eeeeed96c4676569a0cdcb70dbc585"}
{"document_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026", "title": "财务对账与差异处理规范", "scenario": "reconciliation", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026-002", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "财务对账与差异处理规范\n第一条 对账以银行交易流水号和总账外部参考号进行精确匹配，不得仅凭金额相同自动核销。", "labels": ["constraint", "calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/reconciliation_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "2ffa6fc1c460b5f7f2a06863086698119cf7281aaec6240168589d021f7bd0d6"}
{"document_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026", "title": "财务对账与差异处理规范", "scenario": "reconciliation", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026-003", "chunk_index": 3, "text": "财务对账与差异处理规范\n第二条 已匹配但金额不一致的记录标记为金额差异，必须由会计人员复核。", "labels": ["constraint", "calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/reconciliation_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "341c5c2dbed7e3e584e4cd564a4339e9dff0ad8f20a32fd9a2076034834b98e9"}
{"document_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026", "title": "财务对账与差异处理规范", "scenario": "reconciliation", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026-004", "chunk_index": 4, "text": "财务对账与差异处理规范\n第三条 银行有记录而总账无记录的，标记为总账缺失；总账有记录而银行无记录的，标记为银行未达。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/reconciliation_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "4fdb4f518b0e3f67fc1bebc9ce5dcb76cf8d12e58832077726150ff4c0b6fcc8"}
{"document_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026", "title": "财务对账与差异处理规范", "scenario": "reconciliation", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026-005", "chunk_index": 5, "text": "财务对账与差异处理规范\n第四条 同一银行流水号出现多次时标记为重复记录，不得自动汇总后掩盖差异。", "labels": ["constraint"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/reconciliation_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "cd2ac5d469fad2e24e7c0d21e3a937da65275a1bdeaefcaf55bf72b58d4e534c"}
{"document_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026", "title": "财务对账与差异处理规范", "scenario": "reconciliation", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026-006", "chunk_index": 6, "text": "财务对账与差异处理规范\n第五条 差异处理结果必须保留原始记录标识、差异类型和处理状态，支持审计追溯。", "labels": ["constraint"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/reconciliation_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "9a7b04d083b3f38f166de80346f612d296e50ec0e223e84b2c1166722caf5ee1"}
{"document_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026", "title": "财务对账与差异处理规范", "scenario": "reconciliation", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-RECONCILIATION-POLICY-2026-007", "chunk_index": 7, "text": "财务对账与差异处理规范\n第六条 本规范版本为V1.0，自2026年3月1日起生效。", "labels": ["effective"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/reconciliation_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "1ee078a6487470f923ee1c5c53eeffac27a3327c8cbba126774afaa78349b79a"}
{"document_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026", "title": "发票与税务资料管理细则", "scenario": "invoice", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026-001", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "发票与税务资料管理细则\n星汉集团（合成示例）发票与税务资料管理细则\n本文件为星汉集团合成示例，仅用于软件测试，不对应任何真实企业、人员或交易。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/invoice_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "05159602e449066dedb6736fab3fc0eb57db03c779f01032645af32d3a585fbb"}
{"document_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026", "title": "发票与税务资料管理细则", "scenario": "invoice", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026-002", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "发票与税务资料管理细则\n第一条 发票号码、开票日期、销售方、购买方、金额和税额应按结构化字段保存。", "labels": ["calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/invoice_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "49371a1f23c6cebfe027c3f80774ea640ba141f622180be61bed6a9a4fc6bcd7"}
{"document_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026", "title": "发票与税务资料管理细则", "scenario": "invoice", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026-003", "chunk_index": 3, "text": "发票与税务资料管理细则\n第二条 发票影像与结构化字段不一致时，状态设为待复核，不得直接用于自动付款。", "labels": ["constraint"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/invoice_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "66fe811850180791923f6d7df2a824819e2dcdf3562891cb9dfff1edc1b12289"}
{"document_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026", "title": "发票与税务资料管理细则", "scenario": "invoice", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026-004", "chunk_index": 4, "text": "发票与税务资料管理细则\n第三条 税率和税收政策的判断必须记录政策来源及生效日期；知识库没有依据时应拒绝推测。", "labels": ["constraint", "effective"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/invoice_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "4b3a09c49054d4302bbfcda3a53030cfec43fea7f29545de70226142cc6c8a37"}
{"document_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026", "title": "发票与税务资料管理细则", "scenario": "invoice", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026-005", "chunk_index": 5, "text": "发票与税务资料管理细则\n第四条 本细则不提供更广泛税务意见，具体税务处理由具备资质的人员复核。", "labels": ["general"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/invoice_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "19681c2a15ed9cbe3f90b4b6e3c37346e81bfaa246ddde0b48383d3ba04b2afb"}
{"document_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026", "title": "发票与税务资料管理细则", "scenario": "invoice", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-INVOICE-POLICY-2026-006", "chunk_index": 6, "text": "发票与税务资料管理细则\n第五条 本细则版本为V1.0，自2026年1月15日起生效。", "labels": ["effective"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/invoice_policy_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "41bec805ed77a465007de714c08b36d82f570dd6468836466ca4ea4ddca08025"}
{"document_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026", "title": "财务共享工单流转规则", "scenario": "workflow", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026-001", "chunk_index": 1, "text": "财务共享工单流转规则\n星汉集团（合成示例）财务共享工单流转规则\n本文件为星汉集团合成示例，仅用于软件测试，不对应任何真实企业、人员或交易。", "labels": ["approval"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/shared_service_workflow_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "9d38ad2accea9819212e99706d2963c4b8382aa08349651a45b6dfb5c99c471b"}
{"document_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026", "title": "财务共享工单流转规则", "scenario": "workflow", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026-002", "chunk_index": 2, "text": "财务共享工单流转规则\n第一条 工单类型包括费用报销、付款预检、预算调整、对账差异和制度咨询。", "labels": ["approval", "calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/shared_service_workflow_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "858bc2b5602327518243ea677ca4fb693327e301af6ba6b3f43d025b76a575fd"}
{"document_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026", "title": "财务共享工单流转规则", "scenario": "workflow", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026-003", "chunk_index": 3, "text": "财务共享工单流转规则\n第二条 知识查询和只读预检可以直接返回；创建工单必须获得用户明确确认。", "labels": ["approval", "constraint"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/shared_service_workflow_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "45379931ce01b680346577e46927d1e59a4e08f90ae0824c540ee3cd0cdf9eb0"}
{"document_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026", "title": "财务共享工单流转规则", "scenario": "workflow", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026-004", "chunk_index": 4, "text": "财务共享工单流转规则\n第三条 缺少合同、验收单、发票或预算依据时，工单进入待补充状态并列出缺口。", "labels": ["approval", "calculation"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/shared_service_workflow_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "4b45dede6ecf840740daaddb120e7f7909f60b1e93d36241b63f78db9522484b"}
{"document_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026", "title": "财务共享工单流转规则", "scenario": "workflow", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026-005", "chunk_index": 5, "text": "财务共享工单流转规则\n第四条 权限不足、规则冲突和模型输出校验失败时，必须转人工，不得自动放行。", "labels": ["approval", "constraint", "permission"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/shared_service_workflow_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "f6c33e842f943de73d7220114c381d75598dd2fd039695efa598a37e3da1175d"}
{"document_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026", "title": "财务共享工单流转规则", "scenario": "workflow", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026-006", "chunk_index": 6, "text": "财务共享工单流转规则\n第五条 审计日志记录用户角色、场景、工具、结果和规则版本，不记录完整敏感单据。", "labels": ["approval", "permission", "effective"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/shared_service_workflow_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "264ecbe9815a11266188465c4e6f7b968375fb101b931333aa2db05f8c8f9fdc"}
{"document_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026", "title": "财务共享工单流转规则", "scenario": "workflow", "document_type": "policy", "version": "1.0", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "status": "active", "access_level": "public", "source_type": "synthetic", "chunk_id": "POL-SHARED-SERVICE-WORKFLOW-2026-007", "chunk_index": 7, "text": "财务共享工单流转规则\n第六条 本规则版本为V1.0，自2026年3月1日起生效。", "labels": ["approval", "effective"], "source_path": "data/raw/policies/shared_service_workflow_v1_0.pdf", "text_sha256": "1d84d09d46eeedab291b4d86095e4e15e3025ee6423aa2142ade8ddac6c1d2fe"}
